          <p style="flex: none; margin: 0; font-size: .86em;">Not sure which one? Pick <strong style="color: var(--text);">nVidia</strong> only if your machine has an nVidia GPU, otherwise grab <strong style="color: var(--text);">Intel / AMD</strong>.</p>
        </div>
